      "original_text": "Si tan solo pudiéramos saltar\npor encima o algo así...<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "Si tan solo pudiéramos saltar\npor encima o algo así...<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0000,0002,6400>",
